 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "<p>Refer again to the table providing information on classroom capacities and pencil distribution.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody><tr><th>\n</th></tr><tr>\n<td><b>Room Number</b></td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Room Capacity (number of student desks)</b></td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Number of Pencils</b></td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>27</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td>33</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 544674,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine the number of pencils that would be allocated to a classroom F with 28 desks by multiplying the number of desks by the ratio of pencils to desks.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{{\\text{Pencils}}}}{{{\\text{Desks}}}} = \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{p}{{28}}\"></span></p>\n<p><b><span data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\n2p = 84 \\hfill \\\\\np = 42 \\hfill \\\\\n\\end{gathered} \"></span></b></p>\n<p>You need to allocate 42 pencils.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "42 pencils would be allocated."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 544675,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine the number of pencils that would be allocated to a classroom F with 28 desks by dividing the number of desks by the ratio of desks to pencils.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><b><span data-math=\"\\frac{{{\\text{Desks}}}}{{{\\text{Pencils}}}} = \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{{28}}{p}\"></span></b></p>\n<p><b><span data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\n2p = 84 \\hfill \\\\\np = 42 \\hfill \\\\\n\\end{gathered} \"></span></b></p>\n<p>You need to allocate 42 pencils.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "42 pencils would be allocated.\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 544676,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Assuming pencils continued to be distributed in the same manner, if there were another classroom, G, that received 51 pencils, how many desks would we expect to find in the room?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><b><span data-math=\"\\frac{{{\\text{Desks}}}}{{{\\text{Pencils}}}} = \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{d}{{51}}\"></span></b></p>\n<p><b><span data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\n3d = 102 \\hfill \\\\\nd = 34 \\hfill \\\\\n\\end{gathered} \"></span></b></p>\n<p>You need to allocate 34 desks.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "34 desks"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
